 "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L752-L765", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_return_top", "label": "Return To Your Outie Button", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L813-L823", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_module_entry", "label": "Module Entry Script Tag", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L872", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_vendor_scripts", "label": "Deferred Vendor Script Tags", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L860-L863", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_importmap", "label": "Three.js Import Map", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L865-L871", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_noscript", "label": "Noscript Non-Compliant Terminal Fallback", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L874-L882", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_atrium_preload", "label": "Atrium Responsive Image Preload", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "The atrium plate is on screen the instant the boot terminal clears, so it is fetched alongside the stylesheets in the head rather than being discovered later by the lazy plate loader. This makes it the LCP candidate and avoids a blank first frame after the preloader.", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L29-L37", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_persistent_layers", "label": "Persistent Layer Architecture", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "The WebGL canvas, film grain, transition veil, custom pointer and HUD are all placed outside the scroll flow so they survive scene changes and can be driven by a single global timeline instead of being re-created per chapter.", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L43-L68", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_mid_scene_palette_switch", "label": "Mid-Scene Palette Switch", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "The descent chapter deliberately carries no data-palette attribute because it owns its palette itself: the outie-to-innie theme flip must land on the exact frame the severance barrier closes, which the generic per-scene palette controller cannot express.", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L227-L235", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_slat_mask_reveal", "label": "Five-Band Slat Mask Reveal", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "The atrium is revealed through a five-band mask built from a repeating gradient so it opens like blinds and closes the same way when the elevator takes over. The bands are one animated custom property rather than five separate elements, keeping the reveal to a single interpolated value.", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L178-L199", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_geometry_to_photography_handoff", "label": "Geometry-to-Photography Corridor Handoff", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "The photographic corridor plate is matched to the WebGL corridor's vanishing point and opens as an aperture from frame centre as the rendered hallway dims, so the same space is handed from real-time geometry to a still photograph mid-dolly without a visible cut.", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L308-L329", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_faceless_management_files", "label": "Faceless Management Dossiers", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Cobel and Milchick carry no photograph on file. This is deliberate rather than a missing asset: the two cards without a face are the two people watching, so the absence itself carries the surveillance reading.", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L594-L640", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_lamp_masked_plate", "label": "Lamp-Masked Break Room Plate", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "The break room photograph is masked by a radial gradient whose radius is driven by the same flicker timeline as the lamp element, so the room is only visible where the lamp reaches it and the plate and the light source cannot drift out of sync.", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L723-L745", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_chapter_progression", "label": "Eight-Chapter Descent Structure", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L141-L148", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_kier_doctrine", "label": "Nine Core Tenets of Kier", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L692-L708", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_credits", "label": "Build Credits and Attribution", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L826-L853", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "index_module_entry", "target": "js_main", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L872", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_module_entry", "target": "js_main_boot", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "L872", "weight": 1.0}, {"sou